{
  "$schema": "../../../schema/jwsim-test-1.json",
  "$comment": "W5500, display, FRAM y microSD en el mismo bus SPI, dos arranques con memoria compartida. (1) El servidor DHCP guionado responde OFFER y ACK (xid 0x394, el que genera el firmware con la semilla por defecto; MAC 02:4A:57:C4:0A:24) con 192.168.250.10/24, puerta de enlace y DNS 192.168.250.1. FRAM cuenta el arranque 1, la SD está lista y cada 5 s agrega una línea al CSV (log #1 y #2) mientras Ethernet pasa de DHCP pending a OK con la IP ofrecida. (2) Sin tarjeta (SD_CARD=0) y sin servidor DHCP: la FRAM conserva el contador (arranque 2), la SD informa No card y salta el log, y Ethernet sigue en DHCP pending.",
  "sketch": "package:libraries/JWPLC_Ethernet/examples/Ethernet_SPI_Coexistence",
  "runs": [
    {
      "until_ms": 11000,
      "stim": [
        "2680 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 ",
        "3880 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 "
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          "^JWPLC Ethernet \\+ SD \\+ FRAM \\+ Display SPI coexistence test$",
          {
            "match": "^FRAM bootCounter: 1$",
            "count": 1
          },
          "^SD enabled: yes$",
          "^SD present: yes$",
          "^SD ready: yes$",
          "^SD status: OK$",
          {
            "match": "^Display ready$",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: Not started \\| Link: DOWN \\| IP: 0\\.0\\.0\\.0 \\| SD: OK \\| FRAM: OK \\| Boot: 1 \\| Logs: 0$",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: DHCP pending \\| Link: DOWN \\| IP: 0\\.0\\.0\\.0 \\|",
            "min": 1,
            "before_ms": 4380
          },
          {
            "match": "^SD log OK #1$",
            "count": 1,
            "after_ms": 4780,
            "before_ms": 5880
          },
          {
            "match": "^SD log OK #2$",
            "count": 1,
            "after_ms": 9780
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: OK \\| Link: UP \\| IP: 192\\.168\\.250\\.10 \\| SD: OK \\| FRAM: OK \\| Boot: 1 \\| Logs: 2$",
            "min": 1,
            "after_ms": 9880
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "^ERROR",
          "FRAM not available",
          "SD log (skipped|failed)"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "until_ms": 7000,
      "stim": [
        "0 SD_CARD=0"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          {
            "match": "^FRAM bootCounter: 2$",
            "count": 1
          },
          "^SD present: no$",
          "^SD ready: no$",
          "^SD status: No card$",
          {
            "match": "^SD log skipped: No card$",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: DHCP pending \\| Link: DOWN \\| IP: 0\\.0\\.0\\.0 \\| SD: No card \\| FRAM: OK \\| Boot: 2 \\| Logs: 0$",
            "min": 3
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "^SD log OK",
          "ETH: OK"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
